# Cloud Incident Manager — AWS EKS DevOps & Break-Fix Lab

A hands-on DevOps engineering project demonstrating containerized application development, Infrastructure as Code, AWS infrastructure, Kubernetes orchestration, CI/CD automation, and cloud troubleshooting.

The project deploys a Python-based incident management application to Amazon EKS. GitHub Actions automates code validation, Docker image builds, and publishing container images to Amazon Elastic Container Registry (ECR) using AWS OpenID Connect (OIDC) authentication.

The environment also includes a Python-based automation runner designed to support future infrastructure troubleshooting and break-fix exercises.

---

